ok 349 CMP-245 a flock that fails (a sysexits code, not the timeout's 1) is no busy section and no timed-out wait: the takeover judges the holder (a live one still refuses) and then runs unguarded, said; a CLI hop runs unserialised, said, never a false rc 124 — flock's own 1 keeps both old readings (thirty-eighth run, a3 DISS-C-002)
