ok 351 CMP-247 a companion the reaper recorded as lock_wait (reaped in queue, its walker never wrote the hop's attempts row) is diagnosed by its own log, never the MODELINV row the lock holder wrote during that wait — whatever the attempts file's last row (thirty-eighth run, a4 DISS-C-001)
