ok 353 CMP-249 a companion result that is valid JSON but no object (null, a number, a string, an array) is no answer: the primary never cedes its shared hop to it, and the fold never calls the companion succeeded — as the INV-5 rewrite already reads it (thirty-eighth run, a4 DISS-C-003)
