ok 355 CMP-251 a primary chain whose every hop was ceded to the companion reaches the merge with no envelope of its own: it gets a failed one naming the cession, so the fold promotes the companion (ceded, not degraded) and a fold that fails still writes a valid envelope; the writer never writes a non-object over the previous round's (thirty-eighth run, a5 DISS-C-001)
